version: "2.0"
description: >-
  Gnomon contracts — versioned TS types and JSON Schemas for the Gnomon
  kernel's hard contracts (docs/specs/gnomon.md §4, §18). Zero runtime deps;
  a community GUI depends on this package only. Contracts change additively or
  with a version bump. PR-0 ships probeResult:v1 only; event:v1, ref:v1,
  refusal:v1 and the gnomon-rpc:v1 hello shape arrive in PR-3. Private, Node
  >= 24, outside the root build until the 8.0 cut.

components:
  gnomon-contracts:
    description: >-
      Package entry (src/index.ts) plus schemas/. probeResult:v1 = {probe, os,
      osVersion, arch, toolVersions{node,...}, verdict pass|fail|partial,
      evidence{}, specRefs[], at}; schemas/probeResult.v1.schema.json is the
      JSON Schema, src/probe-result.ts the TS type plus a hand-written
      zero-dependency validator (validateProbeResultV1 / isProbeResultV1). A
      test keeps the schema's keys and enums in lockstep with the TS side.
    path: src/
    type: module
    tags: [gnomon, contracts, json-schema, paradigm-8]
    tests:
      - test/probe-result.test.ts
